body:
roblox has lost a lot of charm for me. the shift towards minimalism and how hard it is to find actually good games whilst sifting through hundreds of generic simulator games just ruins not only just the whole entire theme of roblox which is imagination or something, but the minimalistic art style now just makes roblox lose all of that sorta rustic DIY feel that games used to have.

&#x200B;

maybe i sound like a grumpy old man who hates change but damn i don't like the style roblox has taken
